//! The `list-style-position` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! the position of the `::marker` relative to a list item.
//!
//! Initial: outside. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - inside: The `::marker` is the first element among the list item's contents.
//! - outside: The `::marker` is outside the principal block box. This is the default value for
//! `list-style`.
//!
//! Grammar: inside | outside
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-lists-3/#propdef-list-style-position
